WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:04.700
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.700 --> 00:08.270
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.270 --> 00:16.180
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.350 --> 00:27.990
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.990 --> 00:33.900
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.900 --> 00:42.840
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.840 --> 00:47.540
Kaze no you ni

00:47.540 --> 00:50.650
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.650 --> 00:54.150
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.150 --> 01:00.690
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.690 --> 01:07.430
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.430 --> 01:13.570
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.570 --> 01:20.240
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.240 --> 01:27.550
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:52.470 --> 01:54.810
Project Leviathan...

01:54.810 --> 01:58.440
The plan to resurrect
witches is all right here...

02:31.010 --> 02:33.250
I bet it would look good on her, but...

02:33.250 --> 02:35.080
It's a little expensive.

02:35.080 --> 02:36.780
Whoops!

02:36.780 --> 02:38.190
Sorry about that, amigo.

02:38.190 --> 02:40.360
What the hell was that, you bastard?!

02:40.360 --> 02:44.130
♪ Taco, taco, tacos! Tasty tacos! ♪

02:44.130 --> 02:46.630
That's really become a
favorite of yours, hasn't it?

02:46.630 --> 02:48.500
You wouldn't sing it, Nadie?

02:48.500 --> 02:51.000
It's not that I wouldn't, but...

02:51.000 --> 02:52.330
How do I put this?

02:52.330 --> 02:57.110
You know, when someone gets drunk first,
you feel hesitant to do the same.

02:57.110 --> 02:59.870
- It's like that.
- But I'm not drunk.

02:59.870 --> 03:01.870
It was just an analogy.

03:03.440 --> 03:06.140
Now, where did the key go?

03:09.020 --> 03:12.320
Oh? Hmm...

03:14.690 --> 03:16.860
Oh...

03:16.860 --> 03:18.030
It fell.

03:18.030 --> 03:22.030
No way! I'd only taken one sip of it.

03:22.030 --> 03:24.300
This cup is drunk, huh?

03:24.300 --> 03:26.970
Why, you!

03:26.970 --> 03:29.070
It fought back...

03:29.070 --> 03:32.340
- That's lashing out.
- Oh, shut up.

03:32.340 --> 03:34.480
- No, that.
- Huh?

03:34.480 --> 03:37.540
An apology doesn't cut it, you idiot!

03:39.710 --> 03:43.310
Standing like a fool in the
middle of the street! You retard!

03:45.150 --> 03:47.210
Say something! Eh?!

03:55.000 --> 03:58.730
Now, now, don't get so
worked up about it, amigo.

03:58.730 --> 04:01.170
You're the one who bumped into me.

04:01.170 --> 04:04.710
Shuddup! The hell you calling
me "amigo" for, you tomato?!

04:04.710 --> 04:06.340
Acting like some numbskull...

04:06.340 --> 04:08.710
Okay, that's enough.

04:08.710 --> 04:10.110
Who the hell're you?

04:10.110 --> 04:12.450
I'm no one of consequence.

04:12.450 --> 04:17.450
She's a bounty hunter who spilled
coffee and took it out on the cup.

04:17.450 --> 04:20.090
You needn't say such unnecessary things.

04:20.090 --> 04:21.860
Yessir.

04:21.860 --> 04:23.930
A bounty hunter?

04:23.930 --> 04:26.020
You?

04:31.200 --> 04:34.070
If you have any last words, say them now.

04:34.070 --> 04:35.970
Y-You idiot! Quit it!

04:35.970 --> 04:37.870
I'm not quitting.

04:40.240 --> 04:42.240
Bye-bye.

04:42.240 --> 04:44.210
Ka-blam.

04:46.210 --> 04:48.380
There, case closed.

05:07.470 --> 05:09.940
You mustn't fall asleep.

05:09.940 --> 05:14.100
L.A., open your eyes.

05:17.410 --> 05:20.250
Now, repeat it again.

05:20.250 --> 05:23.180
You will repeat it again.

05:23.180 --> 05:27.020
I will never approach Ellis again.

05:27.020 --> 05:29.260
Repeat it again.

05:29.260 --> 05:33.430
I will never approach Ellis again.

05:33.430 --> 05:37.100
I will never... approach her...

05:37.100 --> 05:39.770
Very well.

05:39.770 --> 05:44.110
Tomorrow, I will have you repatriated.

05:44.110 --> 05:48.040
You will behave yourself at the lab
until your future is determined.

05:50.350 --> 05:52.180
Make sure to keep an eye on him.

05:52.180 --> 05:53.780
Yes, sir.

05:53.780 --> 05:56.150
Um, where are you going?

05:56.150 --> 05:58.640
To a world where the sun doesn't exist.

06:00.620 --> 06:02.350
Huh?

06:06.790 --> 06:10.800
♪ Taco, taco, tacos! Tasty tacos! ♪

06:10.800 --> 06:16.140
♪ The most awesome tacos
are Amigo Tacos! Ta-ta, yeah! ♪

06:16.140 --> 06:20.010
♪ Taco, taco, tacos! Tasty tacos! ♪

06:20.010 --> 06:24.180
♪ The most awesome tacos are Amigo Tacos! ♪

06:24.180 --> 06:25.670
Teehee!

06:30.350 --> 06:32.150
A branch store, huh?

06:32.150 --> 06:33.860
This is my wife, Margarita.

06:33.860 --> 06:35.660
Nice to meet you!

06:35.660 --> 06:39.060
I'm Margarita!

06:39.060 --> 06:40.820
H-Hi.

06:44.100 --> 06:46.370
- ls there something?
- It looks good on you.

06:46.370 --> 06:48.770
Well, sorry that it didn't look good on me.

06:48.770 --> 06:50.540
You look sexy.

06:50.540 --> 06:53.170
Well, sorry that I'm not sexy.

06:53.170 --> 06:55.410
The customers must love you.

06:55.410 --> 06:58.740
If you don't shut up already,
I'm going to put a hole in you.

07:02.380 --> 07:05.420
Let me introduce myself properly. I'm Antonio.

07:05.420 --> 07:07.690
Thank you for what you did earlier.

07:07.690 --> 07:09.350
I'm Nadie.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.930
What brings you to this town?

07:17.930 --> 07:21.570
Do you have some business here, Nadie?

07:21.570 --> 07:24.740
Oh, no. We're traveling.

07:24.740 --> 07:26.440
Traveling? Where to?

07:26.440 --> 07:28.480
Oh, uh...

07:28.480 --> 07:31.780
Well, I'm not really prepared to answer where...

07:35.620 --> 07:37.450
Antonio!

07:42.720 --> 07:45.090
Ah! Well, well!

07:45.090 --> 07:47.960
Why'd she get dressed up in that?

07:47.960 --> 07:50.600
- Does it look good on me?
- It does, it does!

07:50.600 --> 07:52.400
You look fabulous, Ellis!

07:52.400 --> 07:54.800
- Sexy?
- Not at all.

07:54.800 --> 07:57.240
Mmm...

07:57.240 --> 07:58.640
What the?

07:58.640 --> 08:00.740
That's good, Ellis.

08:00.740 --> 08:03.740
But it'll sound even sexier
if you put your nose into it.

08:03.740 --> 08:05.580
Mmm!

08:05.580 --> 08:08.650
Oh, Margarita!

08:08.650 --> 08:10.280
Antonio!

08:10.280 --> 08:12.690
Put my nose into it? Like what?

08:12.690 --> 08:14.860
Why don't you try this?

08:14.860 --> 08:16.320
Pepper...

08:16.320 --> 08:18.430
Hey, Margarita,

08:18.430 --> 08:21.000
would you refrain from teaching
her such unnecessary things?

08:21.000 --> 08:22.990
I'll have problems later...

08:27.130 --> 08:29.370
I got your nose into it.

08:29.370 --> 08:31.630
You know...

09:06.040 --> 09:07.840
Why are they smiling?

09:07.840 --> 09:09.580
Because they get along well.

09:09.580 --> 09:11.580
You smile when you get along well?

09:11.580 --> 09:13.480
I suppose.

09:15.380 --> 09:18.020
You don't have to force yourself.

09:18.020 --> 09:20.020
- How's that?!
- Bravo!

09:20.020 --> 09:22.990
Okay, here we go.

09:22.990 --> 09:26.830
Not something that'll ever
be in the cards for me.

09:26.830 --> 09:28.900
I told you to cut it out.

09:28.900 --> 09:31.100
Because we get along.

09:31.100 --> 09:34.160
We get along, even if we don't smile.

09:36.040 --> 09:37.870
I see.

09:39.110 --> 09:41.680
Hey, you'll stay over tonight, right?

09:41.680 --> 09:43.510
What? Oh...

09:43.510 --> 09:46.250
We'd be grateful if you could put us up...

09:46.250 --> 09:47.520
Okay!

09:47.520 --> 09:49.520
I'll go home and get things ready.

09:49.520 --> 09:52.020
- Sure.
- Make yourselves comfortable.

09:52.020 --> 09:53.680
Thank you.

09:58.190 --> 10:00.190
- She's great, isn't she?
- Yeah.

10:00.190 --> 10:03.690
She's so cheerful and kind.
You have a wonderful wife.

10:08.570 --> 10:10.300
Are you here for me?

10:10.300 --> 10:11.710
What?

10:11.710 --> 10:13.570
Marquez hired you, right?

10:13.570 --> 10:17.210
- Marquez?
- We have them.

10:17.210 --> 10:18.750
Those are maracas.

10:18.750 --> 10:20.450
You don't have to play dumb.

10:20.450 --> 10:22.750
I think you've got the wrong idea here.

10:22.750 --> 10:24.920
I don't know any Marquez

10:24.920 --> 10:26.620
and I didn't come here looking for you.

10:26.620 --> 10:28.720
Then what was that when
you shook my hand earlier?

10:28.720 --> 10:31.830
Oh, that was because of your hand.

10:31.830 --> 10:36.600
- My hand?
- Your hand is a hand that has long held a gun.

10:36.600 --> 10:38.770
Same as me.

10:38.770 --> 10:41.000
Your hand has become molded to this shape.

10:42.670 --> 10:45.160
You're a target?

10:47.510 --> 10:52.080
For a long time, I made a living by killing.

10:52.080 --> 10:55.850
But I screwed up three
years ago and got sent to jail.

10:55.850 --> 10:58.590
That's where I met Marquez.

10:58.590 --> 11:01.860
He was serving a life sentence.

11:01.860 --> 11:04.090
Margarita is...

11:04.090 --> 11:06.120
...Marquez's woman.

11:08.460 --> 11:12.130
My friends managed to pull the right strings,

11:12.130 --> 11:15.840
so I was able to get out after two years.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.510
When I was leaving,

11:17.510 --> 11:19.700
Marquez asked me to do something.

11:21.480 --> 11:24.110
He asked me...

11:24.110 --> 11:26.550
...to kill Margarita.

11:26.550 --> 11:28.680
His lover? Why?

11:28.680 --> 11:31.190
Because he loved her.

11:31.190 --> 11:33.390
Marquez was in for life.

11:33.390 --> 11:37.630
He would never be able to
love Margarita ever again.

11:37.630 --> 11:38.960
He would rather do that,

11:38.960 --> 11:42.730
than see Margarita in the arms of another man...

11:46.130 --> 11:48.620
But you couldn't kill her.

11:53.410 --> 11:57.400
Because I found myself face-to-face...

12:03.880 --> 12:06.220
...with a true angel.

12:18.370 --> 12:20.870
Thanks for waiting.

12:20.870 --> 12:23.360
- Give me another one.
- You got it.

12:27.010 --> 12:28.340
Lirio...

12:28.340 --> 12:30.180
- Hey!
- Eh?

12:30.180 --> 12:32.010
Make it over again.

12:32.010 --> 12:33.880
I told you not to make it spicy.

12:33.880 --> 12:37.610
Eh? Did you? I forgot.

12:39.590 --> 12:41.350
You okay?

12:43.560 --> 12:46.730
Well, if it isn't Ricardo.

12:46.730 --> 12:49.060
Long time no see.

12:49.060 --> 12:53.030
Oh. So you're still alive.

12:53.030 --> 12:54.740
Whose kid is that?

12:54.740 --> 12:56.440
What're you doing here?

12:56.440 --> 12:58.240
I'm the one who asked you a question.

12:58.240 --> 13:01.710
You come here chasing some bounty?

13:01.710 --> 13:04.370
Don't you try to swipe my find.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.460
Make it over again.

13:14.460 --> 13:18.060
What? It's not spicy this time.

13:18.060 --> 13:20.050
It tastes bad.

13:35.110 --> 13:37.910
Excellent to see how pliable you are.

13:37.910 --> 13:42.580
Go on, with even greater
exultation in your heart...

13:42.580 --> 13:48.280
...and awaken the true Ellis.

14:10.810 --> 14:15.680
When I met Margarita, I put my past behind me.

14:15.680 --> 14:19.550
I swore that I would never harm
another human being ever again.

14:21.720 --> 14:24.860
Have you told Margarita this?

14:24.860 --> 14:27.830
No, not yet.

14:31.030 --> 14:36.470
Well, maybe it's healthier for a married
couple to have at least one secret.

14:36.470 --> 14:38.970
Nadie.

14:38.970 --> 14:41.080
Oh, you're still awake?

14:41.080 --> 14:43.210
- We're the same.
- What?

14:43.210 --> 14:46.180
You came after me, but we came to get along

14:46.180 --> 14:48.820
and now, we're both being targeted.

14:48.820 --> 14:51.650
O-Oh...

14:51.650 --> 14:55.220
My true objective is to protect Ellis.

14:55.220 --> 15:00.660
But to Ellis, I'm a bounty hunter
who came for her head.

15:00.660 --> 15:05.370
I guess she's accepted that in her own way.

15:05.370 --> 15:08.240
But we smile.

15:08.240 --> 15:11.440
- You're right.
- It's okay to smile, right?

15:11.440 --> 15:13.840
Of course, you bet it is.

15:13.840 --> 15:16.280
I see. I'm glad.

15:16.280 --> 15:18.950
Good night, Nadie.

15:18.950 --> 15:21.120
Good night,

15:21.120 --> 15:22.950
Ellis.

15:24.220 --> 15:26.950
♪ Taco, taco, tacos... ♪

15:26.950 --> 15:29.620
Hurry up and go to sleep.

15:29.620 --> 15:31.780
- What was that sound?
- Shh!

15:33.030 --> 15:35.460
- Nadie.
- Antonio...

15:35.460 --> 15:37.800
The sound, right? I heard it, too.

15:37.800 --> 15:41.200
- I'll go check it out.
- I'm coming with you. Let me go get my gun.

15:41.200 --> 15:43.400
No.

15:43.400 --> 15:46.310
You put your past behind you, right?

15:46.310 --> 15:49.140
You stay close to Margarita.

15:49.140 --> 15:52.280
- Nadie...
- Go on.

15:52.280 --> 15:54.040
Margarita!

16:06.830 --> 16:08.760
Margarita...

16:14.300 --> 16:15.890
Nadie!

16:18.310 --> 16:20.670
- The restaurant.
- Yeah, I saw the gun.

16:20.670 --> 16:23.180
Antonio!

16:23.180 --> 16:25.170
Come on out!

16:26.480 --> 16:28.920
Looks like this one's definitely here for me.

16:28.920 --> 16:32.750
- A hit man?
- Must've been hired by Marquez.

16:32.750 --> 16:34.460
Come unarmed!

16:34.460 --> 16:37.590
Then I'll spare the woman!

16:37.590 --> 16:41.030
You can't go. Once you're
defenseless and he's killed you,

16:41.030 --> 16:42.960
he plans to kill Margarita, too.

16:42.960 --> 16:46.130
After all, Marquez's
primary target is Margarita.

16:46.130 --> 16:48.100
Antonio!

16:48.100 --> 16:49.470
I've put my past behind me.

16:49.470 --> 16:51.870
And I vowed never to harm another human being.

16:51.870 --> 16:54.040
But this is different.

16:54.040 --> 16:55.780
I'm going to fight.

16:55.780 --> 16:57.510
To protect my beloved angel...

16:57.510 --> 17:00.610
To protect everything that matters to me...

17:00.610 --> 17:02.620
Antonio...

17:02.620 --> 17:05.990
- Make it quick!
- I'm coming out!

17:05.990 --> 17:09.390
If I get killed, I'll leave the rest to you.

17:09.390 --> 17:11.150
Antonio?

17:13.530 --> 17:15.360
Margarita!

17:15.360 --> 17:17.630
Wh-What's going on?

17:17.630 --> 17:19.500
Ellis came by just now,

17:19.500 --> 17:22.300
and she told me to hide over in this room.

17:24.200 --> 17:25.710
Good job.

17:25.710 --> 17:29.510
Honestly! I can't decide if that
was thoughtful of her or not!

17:29.510 --> 17:32.510
- I'll go.
- Ellis is my partner.

17:32.510 --> 17:34.520
He doesn't know that.

17:34.520 --> 17:36.580
I'm the one he's after. I'll go!

17:36.580 --> 17:38.210
Antonio.

17:39.650 --> 17:41.990
I overheard you talking.

17:41.990 --> 17:44.360
You know Marquez, don't you?

17:44.360 --> 17:47.090
Why would Marquez want me?

17:48.730 --> 17:52.200
Please. Tell me everything.

17:52.200 --> 17:54.220
Margarita...

17:56.540 --> 18:00.910
What the hell is that bastard Antonio doing?!

18:00.910 --> 18:03.740
Don't move without my
permission! You want to die?!

18:07.450 --> 18:09.350
Damn fool of a girl!

18:09.350 --> 18:11.550
What the hell did he see in a kid like her?

18:11.550 --> 18:13.690
I don't get it at all.

18:13.690 --> 18:15.220
I see.

18:15.220 --> 18:19.390
That's why... Marquez wants me...

18:19.390 --> 18:20.860
And I...

18:20.860 --> 18:23.260
You came to kill me.

18:25.730 --> 18:27.530
I'm right, aren't I?

18:27.530 --> 18:29.070
You must be disappointed.

18:29.070 --> 18:32.370
That you've been living with a guy like that...

18:32.370 --> 18:34.980
Yes, I am disappointed.

18:34.980 --> 18:37.780
Margarita...

18:37.780 --> 18:41.620
I wish you would have told me sooner.

18:41.620 --> 18:45.890
We may not have had a ceremony,
but we're husband and wife.

18:45.890 --> 18:48.720
I wish you hadn't kept any secrets from me.

18:48.720 --> 18:50.550
Margarita...

18:56.060 --> 18:57.900
That settles things, then.

18:57.900 --> 19:01.740
So anyway, I'm going to go rescue my partner.

19:01.740 --> 19:03.300
No, I can't let you do that.

19:03.300 --> 19:05.640
I'm the one that got her involved. I'll go.

19:05.640 --> 19:07.740
Let me have my moment in the spotlight, too.

19:07.740 --> 19:09.140
No, I can't let you.

19:09.140 --> 19:10.680
- Let me!
- No.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.250
- Antonio!
- No!

19:12.250 --> 19:14.610
Why don't you both go rescue her?

19:16.580 --> 19:19.810
I think it would work better that way.

19:21.620 --> 19:23.320
Damn it!

19:23.320 --> 19:25.930
I'm not waiting any longer!

19:25.930 --> 19:27.420
Come here!

19:33.930 --> 19:36.000
I'll provoke him.

19:36.000 --> 19:37.670
When he lowers his guard...

19:37.670 --> 19:38.840
Leave it to me.

19:38.840 --> 19:41.540
Hey, I've come out like you told me to!

19:41.540 --> 19:43.370
Let Margarita go!

19:45.880 --> 19:47.610
Huh?

19:49.480 --> 19:52.520
- Ellis?
- What happened to him?

19:52.520 --> 19:54.610
He's inside.

20:00.790 --> 20:03.360
They got cracked a little.

20:03.360 --> 20:06.300
- You are just so...
- Ellis!

20:08.240 --> 20:10.070
I'm back.

20:17.580 --> 20:20.310
I had no idea maracas could serve as weapons.

20:20.310 --> 20:23.550
Only for her.

20:23.550 --> 20:25.250
What's wrong?

20:33.560 --> 20:35.760
Nadie?

20:35.760 --> 20:37.400
Let's get this guy taken care of.

20:37.400 --> 20:39.530
Keep Ellis from seeing him.

20:39.530 --> 20:41.090
Huh?

20:57.680 --> 20:59.120
So long.

20:59.120 --> 21:01.190
Sorry for all the mess I got you into.

21:01.190 --> 21:04.520
I'm used to trouble.

21:04.520 --> 21:06.960
Eat these on your way.

21:06.960 --> 21:09.700
♪ Taco, taco, tacos? ♪

21:09.700 --> 21:11.130
They're tasty.

21:11.130 --> 21:14.030
- Thank you.
- Well, then...

21:14.030 --> 21:15.900
Be careful.

21:18.040 --> 21:20.710
Oh, that's right...

21:20.710 --> 21:23.640
Hey, Margarita...

21:23.640 --> 21:27.250
Could you tell me one last thing?

21:27.250 --> 21:29.080
What is it, Nadie?

21:29.080 --> 21:31.550
What is it about Antonio
that you fell in love with?

21:36.060 --> 21:37.920
Take care!

21:37.920 --> 21:39.980
Bye-bye!

21:43.900 --> 21:47.930
He reminds me of a dog I used to have long ago.

21:47.930 --> 21:50.970
That's awesome!

21:50.970 --> 21:52.960
Woof, woof, woof.

22:11.490 --> 22:13.590
Project Leviathan...

22:13.590 --> 22:17.930
The project surpasses anything I had imagined.

22:17.930 --> 22:21.260
If this project were to succeed,
the world would...

22:28.610 --> 22:33.670
You look more gorgeous without glasses.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.890
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.890 --> 22:47.790
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.790 --> 22:55.960
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.210 --> 23:05.710
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.710 --> 23:11.490
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.490 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.560
Akai hoshi no yoru

